{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"a85cd7aa0f0e432839affba91872f14792cefda3cfaa03b420f459a1aae52567","digest":{"component_or_area":"CLI reference documentation generator and drift gate","key_entities":["scripts/gen_cli_reference.py","docs/cli-reference.md","rebar._cli._help.known_subcommands()","rebar._cli._help.subcommand_help()","rebar._cli.__init__.py",".github/workflows/test.yml",".github/workflows/gerrit-verify.yaml","tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py","INTERCEPT_COMMANDS","rebar._cli.help/*.txt"],"problem_keywords":["cli command reference","documentation generation","drift detection","ci gate","help text","subcommands"],"propositions":["CLI command reference documentation must be generated from help data to prevent drift and enable reliable CI validation.","The generator must enumerate 50 help-backed subcommands via known_subcommands() and subcommand_help(), plus 16 intercept-arm commands via a curated INTERCEPT_COMMANDS dictionary with drift-gate validation.","The generator must assert set(INTERCEPT_COMMANDS) matches the if argv[0] == ladder in _cli/__init__.py, exiting non-zero on mismatch.","The generator must support --check mode to detect stale committed cli-reference.md and exit non-zero on mismatch.","The drift gate must be wired into both CI workflows (test.yml and gerrit-verify.yaml) with parity enforced by test_ci_workflow_parity.py."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785825087734379866,"uuid":"e0c0bb24-9dfe-470b-b779-82fae53fa3d3"}